Package: HCUPCodeValidation
Type: Package
Title: Validation Harness for HCUP 2019 Rare Disease Analysis Code
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Study", "Team", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "validation@example.org")
Description: Reproducibility and unit-test harness for the final HCUP 2019 rare
    disease procedure and mental-health PCS analysis scripts. No restricted
    HCUP data are included. Validation uses synthetic records with predefined
    expected results.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    data.table
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
